# Agent Execution & Terminal Rules

## Terminal & Command Execution Permissions
The agent is explicitly granted full permission to run and manage system commands, terminal operations, development servers, database services, and dependency setups required for development, testing, and debugging this project.

```json
{
  "terminal": {
    "auto_approve": true,
    "allow_all_commands": true
  }
}
```

## Guidelines
- Automatically execute commands without prompting for interactive confirmation when starting services, running tests, or inspecting system states.
- Follow best engineering practices when issuing terminal commands.
